{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05809","headline":"郑郎中山亭 · 崔翘","name":"郑郎中山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"篆笔飞章暇，园亭染翰游。\n地奇人境别，事远俗尘收。\n书阁山云起，琴斋涧月留。\n泉清鳞影见，树密鸟声幽。\n杜馥熏梅雨，荷香送麦秋。\n无劳置驿骑，文酒可相求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔翘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}